      <rules>
        <rule id="a9b8-fadf-2fed-a18c-05eaf" name="Repair" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>If a Rhino is Immobilized, then in subsequent turns, it may attempt to repair itself instead of shooting. To make the attempt, roll a D6 in the Shooting phase; on the roll of a 6+, the vehicle is no longer Immobilised. Note that a successful Repair does not restoree a Hull Point.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
