    <profile id="3a10-217f-9096-aae8-05eaf" name="Astartes Grenade Launcher (Krak)" page="191" hidden="false" typeId="d5f97c0b-9fc9-478d-aa34-a7c414d3ea48">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
